text = "Undo - Control + Z
Redo - Control + Shift + Z / Control + Y
Duplicate selected object - Control + D
Delete selected object - Delete / X
Deselect object - Alt + D / Alt + Left Click

Open rotation gizmo - R
Rotate selected object 90° - E
Rotate selected object -90° - Q
Move selected object up 1 tile - W / Up Arrow
Move selected object left 1 tile - A / Left Arrow
Move selected object down 1 tile - S / Down Arrow
Move selected object right 1 tile - D / Right Arrow

Hold Shift to halve movement. Ex. Shift + W moves 0.5 tiles instead of 1 tile."
